#!/bin/sh /etc/rc.common
# BPI-R4 A/B: 启动成功后清除升级标记，防止 altbootcmd 误判回滚
START=99
STOP=01

boot() {
	[ -x /usr/sbin/fw_printenv ] || return 0
	[ -r /etc/fw_env.config ] || return 0

	local up
	up="$(fw_printenv -n upgrade_available 2>/dev/null)"
	[ "$up" = "1" ] || return 0

	fw_setenv upgrade_available 0 && fw_setenv bootcount 0 && fw_setenv altcount 0
	logger -t ab-confirm "A/B: slot confirmed good, upgrade_available cleared"
}
